From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] netcfgx: read-only network configuration (3558)

netcfgx: read-only network configuration

INetCfg keeps an initialized state (Initialize twice gives NETCFG_E_ALREADY_INITIALIZED, calls before
Initialize NETCFG_E_NOT_INITIALIZED); the write lock is system wide (a named semaphore, with the
holder's description visible to other clients, E_ACCESSDENIED for non-administrators,
NETCFG_E_ALREADY_INITIALIZED after Initialize); Apply and Cancel need the lock. EnumComponents,
FindComponent and QueryNetCfgClass (new INetCfgClass in netcfgx.idl) list the software components of
this system, the TCP/IPv4 and TCP/IPv6 protocol drivers, as INetCfgComponent objects. Removes the
todo_wine marks in the conformance test that now pass.
---
